Recommends: wireguard-tools,
Description: web admin for WireGuard servers
 WebWG runs WireGuard servers on this machine and lets admins approve
 devices, add peers and hand out their configs from a browser.
 .
 Devices can ask to join from a page where their keys are made in the
 browser and never sent anywhere, or with the cliwg.py client.
